# TEEgris from bootloader rev2 (R870XXS2JZG3) rejects the trustlets shipped
# in the R870XXU1IYI1 vendor ("TA_PKG: model name does not match"), so the
# JZG3 trustlets are bind-mounted over the vendor ones before tzdaemon
# starts (vendor teegris.rc starts it on post-fs). A plain init 'mount'
# gets EACCES, so the mounts run in the Magisk domain.
on fs
    exec u:r:magisk:s0 root root -- /system/bin/sh ${MAGISKTMP}/tee-jzg3.sh ${MAGISKTMP}
